  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 1834,
      "text": "Allah said, “O Iblīs, what is the matter with you that you were not with those who prostrated?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1835,
      "text": "He said, “I am not such to prostrate before a human whom You created from sounding clay, made of aging mud.[14]”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1836,
      "text": "He said, “Then get out of here[15], for you are accursed,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1837,
      "text": "and the curse will be upon you until the Day of Judgment.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1838,
      "text": "Iblīs said, “My Lord, then grant me respite until the Day they are resurrected.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1839,
      "text": "Allah said, “You are of those who are granted respite[16],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1840,
      "text": "until the Day of the Appointed Time[17].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1841,
      "text": "He said, “My Lord, since You have sent me astray[18], I will surely make [sins] alluring to them on earth and mislead them all,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1842,
      "text": "except for Your chosen slaves among them.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1843,
      "text": "Allah said, “This is a straight path leading to Me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1844,
      "text": "You will have no authority over My slaves, except the deviants who follow you.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1845,
      "text": "And Hell is certainly the promised place for them, all together.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1846,
      "text": "It has seven gates[19]; each gate will have its allotted share of them.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1847,
      "text": "The righteous will be in gardens and springs.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1848,
      "text": "“Enter in peace and safety[20]!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1849,
      "text": "We will remove all ill feelings from their hearts[21]; like brothers, seated on couches facing one another.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1850,
      "text": "No fatigue will ever touch them therein[22], nor will they ever be made to leave.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1851,
      "text": "Inform My slaves that I am indeed the All-Forgiving, the Most Merciful,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1852,
      "text": "and that My punishment is the most painful punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1853,
      "text": "And inform them about the guests of Abraham.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
